  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-round-table · 圆桌骑士",
      "text": "**中文** | [English](README.en.md)\n\n让多个 Agent 原窗口在同一场会议中讨论、协作和交付。普通问答直接发送；需要执行时，由所选成员生成任务卡，核对后发布。成员工作日志、共享资料、自由步骤和独立秘书纪要集中在会议内，成员保留原会话与上下文。\n\n**当前版本1.0.0。** 本版仅调整版本编号，功能沿用已验收的0.1.18。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "**宿主要求：Windows DeepSeek Harness 0.2.0-rc.2，目标 profile 为 desktop。** 在桌面「插件」页添加 `dsh-round-table@1.0.0`，然后从应用菜单或托盘**退出**并重新打开，点击侧栏「圆桌」。仅关闭窗口不等于完全退出。\n\n也可使用桌面发行版自带的 CLI；先退出应用，不使用 PATH 中可能属于其他安装的裸 `dsh`：\n\n```powershell\n$desktopCli = Join-Path $env:LOCALAPPDATA 'Programs/DeepSeek Harness/resources/runtime/cli/bin/dsh.cmd'\n& $desktopCli --version   # 应为 0.2.0-rc.2\n& $desktopCli plugin --profile desktop add 'dsh-round-table@1.0.0'\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "[npm本版入口](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-round-table/v/1.0.0) · [GitHub Release 与本地安装包](https://github.com/whateverboy2333/dsh-round-table/releases/tag/v1.0.0) · [完整安装、构建与恢复指南](docs/配置指南.md#中文详细指南)"
    },
    {
      "section": "五步开始",
      "text": "1. **建会并选人：** 填写目标、背景与工作区，邀请已有窗口或从宿主预设新建成员。创建会发送入会简报，成员可能回应；每会有独立秘书。\n2. **先讨论：** 输入 `@` 并从菜单选成员，发送普通问题；没有选人时只记录到会议。图片、文档可拖入，截图可粘贴。Enter发送／记录，Ctrl／⌘+Enter换行。\n3. **需要工作时生成卡：** 已@成员后点击「任务卡生成」，正文可为空。每个待办返回一张卡；生成和调整不执行卡内工作，不自动识别聊天意图来派任务。\n4. **核对后发布：** 直接修改正文，或让原生成者按意见调整；保存、确认责任成员并选择卡片，再确认发布。批准版本先写本会目录，随后通知所选成员执行；提交结果与人工验收分开。\n5. **持续跟进：** 在右侧成员日志查看回应和工作状态；固定协作可在进程页自行编排。秘书按需生成纪要草稿，核对后再选择公开、通知或导出。"
    },
    {
      "section": "界面与用法",
      "text": "以下为**0.1.18生产React界面**，使用合成会议、成员与材料，**不是实际Agent执行结果**；主窗口为布局示例。"
    },
    {
      "section": "讨论与并排工作",
      "text": "默认380px侧栏与原页面并排，可拖宽；关掉再打开恢复默认大小。正文与附件同条发送，上传仅归档。图片能否交给Agent读取仍取决于模型能力。"
    },
    {
      "section": "任务卡：生成、修改、选择发布",
      "text": "生成者与责任成员分别显示。原稿、手工修改和AI调整建议保留版本，晚到建议不覆盖用户编辑；只有核对选定版本并确认发布才通知执行。"
    },
    {
      "section": "成员详情与会议工作日志",
      "text": "右侧边栏集中显示本会资料、投递、回应、正式成果及验收。执行需要时恢复同一原会话；归档、删除或身份无法确认时提示处理，不创建替代窗口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "自由步骤：顺序、并行和删除",
      "text": "从空白开始，直接改标题，每行选择成员，同一Agent可负责多个环节。任意阶段可并行，标题栏常驻删除，自动运行默认关闭。保存只记录安排；首轮预览确认启动首阶段，并授权已勾选的后续规则，未勾选的后续步骤仍手动。活动结构及已开始字段冻结，旧图与历史保留。\n\n<details>\n<summary>查看暗色步骤列表</summary>\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "资料与会议文件夹",
      "text": "本会成功上传的文档、图片及版本均归档，移除草稿引用不删原件。工作区中的专属会议文件夹保存材料、批准任务卡、成果和纪要，成员按批准版本读取。"
    },
    {
      "section": "秘书纪要",
      "text": "先生成草稿，再核对会议来源和任务事实。公开到会议只新增记录；发送通知才唤醒成员，也可以保留不发送。纪要不能自动证明全部内容正确。"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用边界",
      "text": "- 仅上述桌面版本；成员在同一DSH进程，同一DSH_HOME只运行一个圆桌队列宿主。不支持跨机器或定时纪要。\n- 日志不自动公开其他私聊；成员保留原上下文及文件权限，会议资料选择不构成权限隔离。秘书不执行普通成员工作。\n- 图片投递需模型适配器明确支持，当前DeepSeek适配器不支持；PDF、Office、RAR等可保存完整原件，不自动解析或解压。具体大小见[指南](docs/配置指南.md#资料与纪要)。\n- 保存流程不启动工作；生成或调整任务卡会请求成员分析，确认发布才执行卡内工作，纪要生成也会使用模型。送达、提交与验收是不同状态；不确定投递先核对，重试可能重复。执行额度不是Token或费用硬上限。\n- 升级前备份数据。永久删除会议需二次确认且无回收站；普通成员与工作文件保留，停止会议不终止原Agent。旧版本回退依赖完整备份。"
    },
    {
      "section": "深入阅读与维护",
      "text": "[完整双语使用指南](docs/配置指南.md) · [PRD](docs/PRD.md) · [ENGINEERING](docs/ENGINEERING.md) · [工具／HTTP API](docs/产品实现速查.md) · [Agent维护入口](CLAUDE.md)\n\n公开 `npm run verify` 检查类型和包内容；内部124套回归与225项浏览器证据不随仓库发布。main文档可更新，v0.1.18标签和既发资产保持不变。\n\nMIT © whateverboy2333"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh-round-table",
      "text": "[中文](README.md) | **English**\n\nBring existing Agent sessions into one meeting for discussion, collaboration and delivery. Send ordinary questions directly. For work, ask selected members to generate task cards, review them and confirm publication. Member logs, shared materials, free steps and dedicated secretary minutes stay together; members keep their original sessions and context.\n\n**Current version: 1.0.0.** Only the version number changes; functionality retains the accepted 0.1.18 baseline."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "**Host requirement: Windows DeepSeek Harness 0.2.0-rc.2 with the desktop profile.** Add `dsh-round-table@1.0.0` from the desktop **Plugins** page, then **Quit** through the application menu or tray and reopen it. Select Round table in the sidebar. Closing the window may leave the app running.\n\nAlternatively, quit the app first and use its bundled CLI. A bare `dsh` on PATH may belong to another installation:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "```powershell\n$desktopCli = Join-Path $env:LOCALAPPDATA 'Programs/DeepSeek Harness/resources/runtime/cli/bin/dsh.cmd'\n& $desktopCli --version   # Must be 0.2.0-rc.2\n& $desktopCli plugin --profile desktop add 'dsh-round-table@1.0.0'\n```\n\n[npm version entry](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-round-table/v/1.0.0) · [GitHub Release and local archive](https://github.com/whateverboy2333/dsh-round-table/releases/tag/v1.0.0) · [Full installation, build and recovery guide](docs/配置指南.md#english-guide)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Start in five steps",
      "text": "1. **Create and invite:** Enter the goal, background and workspace. Invite existing sessions or create members from host presets. Creation sends briefings and members may respond; each meeting has its own secretary.\n2. **Discuss first:** Type `@` and select members from the menu to send ordinary questions. With no recipients, only record to the meeting. Drag files or paste screenshots. Enter sends/records; Ctrl/Cmd+Enter inserts a newline.\n3. **Generate work cards when needed:** Select members, then choose Generate task cards. Extra prose may be empty; each item becomes one card. Generation and adjustments do not execute the proposed work. There is no automatic intent-based dispatch.\n4. **Review and publish:** Edit directly or ask the original generator to adjust a card. Save, confirm assignees and select versions, then confirm publication. Approved files are written before execution notifications. Formal submission and human acceptance are separate.\n5. **Follow progress:** Use the right member log for replies and work state. Arrange repeatable collaboration in Process. Generate secretary minutes on demand, review the draft, then choose publication, notifications or export."
    },
    {
      "section": "Interface and usage",
      "text": "These are **0.1.18 production React interfaces** with synthetic meetings, members and materials, **not real Agent execution results**. The main window is a layout example."
    },
    {
      "section": "Discussion beside the original window",
      "text": "A 380px drawer reflows the original page beside it. Drag to resize; reopening resets the width. Text and attachments send together; upload only archives. Agent image reading depends on the selected model."
    },
    {
      "section": "Task cards: generate, edit and choose publication",
      "text": "Generators and assignees are distinct. Originals, edits and AI suggestions retain versions; late suggestions never overwrite user edits. Only confirming chosen versions authorizes execution notifications."
    },
    {
      "section": "Member details and meeting work log",
      "text": "The right sidebar gathers this meeting's materials, delivery, replies, results and review. Execution restores the same original session when needed; archived, deleted or unverified identities require attention, never a replacement context."
    },
    {
      "section": "Free steps: sequence, parallel work and deletion",
      "text": "Start empty, edit titles in place and assign a member in every row; reuse an Agent across steps. Any stage can become parallel. Delete is visible in each header and automatic execution is off by default. Saving only records the arrangement. Initial confirmation starts the first stage and authorizes selected future automatic rules; unchecked future steps remain manual. Active topology and started fields are frozen; old graphs and history remain."
    },
    {
      "section": "Free steps: sequence, parallel work and deletion",
      "text": "<details>\n<summary>View the dark step list</summary>\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Materials and the meeting directory",
      "text": "Every successfully uploaded document, image and version is archived; removing a draft reference keeps the original. A dedicated workspace directory stores materials, approved cards, results and minutes. Members read exact approved versions."
    },
    {
      "section": "Secretary minutes",
      "text": "Generate a draft, then review sources and task facts. Publishing adds a meeting record; notifying wakes members. Keeping a draft without sending is valid. Minutes do not certify that all generated content is correct."
